      "headline": "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Beats OpenAI’s GPT-5.6 Sol And Anthropic’s Opus 5 On Coding And Cybersecurity At An ~86x Lower Cost, While Reducing HBM Requirements By 3.8x And SSD Ones By 8x",
